<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS5.SSS2" title="In A.5 Training Data Examples ‣ Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Extract-0: A Specialized Language Model for Document Information Extraction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5.2 </span>Example 2: Physics Relationship Extraction</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS5.SSS3" title="In A.5 Training Data Examples ‣ Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Extract-0: A Specialized Language Model for Document Information Extraction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5.3 </span>Example 3: Financial Regulatory Extraction</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
